	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダムZZ』より、マシュマー機の特別仕様を精密・忠実に再現したキットです。各関節は広い可動範囲を持ち、ビーム・ライフルでの攻撃姿勢やビーム・キャノンの発射状態など、戦闘時のポージングを劇中での印象通りに再現可能にしています。オプションラックシールド、ビームサーベルも付いています。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM ZZ\", it is a kit that precisely and faithfully reproduces the special specifications of the marshmar machine. Each joint has a wide range of motion, making it possible to reproduce the pose during battle, such as the attack posture of the beam rifle and the firing state of the beam cannon, as the impression in the play. It also comes with an optional rack shield and beam saber."
		]
	},
